  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2015/09/P1160506.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"color: rgb(20, 24, 35); font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; line-height: 18.76px;\">(26 fotos) 5 Lobitos, en la plaza Zayyan, 1 de Onda, junto al colegio Virgen del Carmen, ha acogido 2 showrooms organizados por OH VINTAGE by Carmen Cobo con bolsos de firmas como Chanel, Louis Vuitton, Prada, Miu Miu, Loewe, Marni o CH. La primera sesi&oacute;n se ha celebrado la tarde del viernes con &eacute;xito y la segunda la ma&ntilde;ana de este s&aacute;bado, con m&aacute;s asistencia si cabe.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160475.jpg\" alt=\"p1160475\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160476.jpg\" alt=\"p1160476\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160478.jpg\" alt=\"p1160478\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160481.jpg\" alt=\"p1160481\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160483.jpg\" alt=\"p1160483\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160485.jpg\" alt=\"p1160485\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160486.jpg\" alt=\"p1160486\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/showroombolsos5lobitos/p1160487.jpg\" alt=